{"id":"00466","root":"uni00466_1","name":{"ja":"感染者","en":"Infected"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"感染者","en":"Infected"},"element":"Science","rarity":1,"rarityLabel":"N","roles":[],"traits":["Undead"],"release":null,"limited":false,"characterId":276,"profile":{"ja":"次元侵略者のウィルス兵器によって特殊なウィルスに感染した元人間。全身の体毛は抜け落ち、犬のように呼吸が早く顔は知性を失い凶暴そうな異形の風体をしている。異常な怪力。ほとんどの知覚能力は弱いが血の匂いに敏感、1キロ先でもその匂いを嗅ぎつけるという。紫外線にあたると皮膚が火傷を追うため昼間は暗闇に潜んでいる。噛まれるとウィルスに感染し平均48時間以内で“感染者”へと変容し仲間入りしてしまう。","en":"They are a former human infected with a special virus from the dimensional invader's virus weapon, resulting in a loss of body hair, rapid breathing like a dog, and a brutal, bestial appearance with a loss of intelligence. They possess abnormal strength, but most of their sensory abilities are weak, except for a keen sensitivity to the smell of blood, which they can detect from over a kilometer away. Their skin burns when exposed to ultraviolet light, forcing them to hide in darkness during the day. If they bite someone, the victim will become infected with the virus and transform into an Infected within 48 hours on average, joining their ranks."},"illustrator":null,"voiceActor":null,"forms":[{"id":"uni00466_1","rarity":1,"rarityLabel":"N","levelMax":40,"stats":{"hp":[648,1292],"sp":[100,100],"atk":[67,133],"def":[74,149],"spd":[45,45],"luck":[0,0]},"spCharge":34,"skills":["5","1090003"]}],"skills":{"5":{"slot":"attack","id":5,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Science damage"}]},"1090003":{"slot":"skill1","id":1090003,"name":{"ja":"むさぼり"},"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":100,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に小威力で攻撃、中確率で毒状態にする"}},{"level":2,"sp":100,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に小威力で攻撃、中確率で毒状態にする"}},{"level":3,"sp":100,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体